OL,2,W+.!/*% *%*%/*%,.! /.!/*%,.!S,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 20 SEP
OL,4,CRADIO TRANSMITTERS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FFollowing many months of trials,
OL,7,Fthe BBC formally launches RDS (Radio
OL,8,FData System) from a number of
OL,9,Ftransmitter sites.
OL,10,
OL,11,FRadio receivers equipped with RDS
OL,12,Fcapability could:
OL,13,
OL,14,F(a) Display the radio station name
OL,15,F(maximum of 8 characters);
OL,16,F(b) Identify and retune to a
OL,17,Ftransmitter with a stronger signal of
OL,18,Fthe current radio station (geared
OL,19,Ftowards car radios);
OL,20,F(c) Interrupt current radio listening
OL,21,Fand switch to a station providing
OL,22,Ftraffic updates;
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
